# Captain America, Living Legend: "Whenever a creature you control becomes tapped during your turn, if it's the first time
# that creature has become tapped this turn, untap it." Savannah Lions attacking (turn 5) is untapped by it. Llanowar
# Elves tapped for mana twice in the same turn (turn 5): untapped the first time only. A Mox, which is no creature, stays
# tapped (turn 3), as does Bot2's Llanowar Elves tapped for mana in Bot1's turn (turn 5): not Bot1's creature.

